<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     58.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     57.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     52.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows:  300-550 lbs 0.25-0.50 higher; 550-700 lbs 1.00-1.50</p>
<p>higher. Top 50.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     46.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     50.00</p>
</text>
